อออออออออออออออออออออออออออต MISCELLANEOUS COMMANDS ฦออออออออออออออออออออออออ

DELETE,F1       Help            List all MAG commands
CTRL-H,BS,F2    Help            Tell you what a certain dungeon symbol is
CTRL-W          Wizard          Enter/exit wizard mode
a,F5            Already-used    Print all magic items already used
g               Get             Pick up an object from the floor under you
o,F4            Option          Set/print option(s) such as multirest
s               Search          Look around you for secret doors and traps
v,F6            View            Print out what you can see around you
A               Adventuring     Show International Standard Adventuring Time
E               Extinguish      Put out a wall torch
F               Food            Tells you how hungry you are
G               Genocided       Tells you which monsters you have genocided
P,C             Pack/Carrying   Tells you how full your pack is
Q               Quit            End the game
R               Remember        Store the game to play another day or time
T               Title           Print the adventurers experience level title
V               Version         Print current version number of MAG
~,F10           Shell           Exit MAG temporarily to a DOS
